 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "This, this, these",
     "texto": [
      "In the nominative and before a noun, «this» agrees with it in gender and number: **этот** (masculine), **эта** (feminine), **это** (neuter) and **эти** (plural).",
      "**этот** свитер (this jumper), **эта** куртка (this jacket), **это** платье (this dress), **эти** туфли (these shoes).",
      "The demonstrative follows the Russian gender of the noun, even though English «this» never changes: **это платье** = «this dress».",
      "Don't confuse it with the **это** you already know («this is…»), which never changes: **Это куртка** = this is a jacket.",
      "In the nominative, «that» agrees in the same way: **тот**, **та**, **то**, **те**. For example, **то платье** = that dress."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "The demonstratives",
