    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clothes",
     "texto": [
      "**Одежда** means «clothes». **Рубашка** (shirt), **футболка** (T-shirt), **свитер** (jumper), **куртка** (jacket), **пальто** (coat), **платье** (dress), **юбка** (skirt), **шапка** (hat).",
      "Always in the plural: **брюки** (trousers), **джинсы** (jeans) and **туфли** (shoes)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I like it, I like them",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike in English, the verb changes if what is liked is plural: **Мне нравится эта куртка** (I like this jacket), **мне нравятся эти туфли** (I like these shoes).",
      "They sound almost the same, but they are spelled differently.",
      "**Смотри!** = look! **Какое красивое платье!** = what a pretty dress!"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
